Input: {"question": "Which sports team does Alex Di Rocco represent or represent?", "source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 84, "text": "**BREAKING: Alex Di Rocco Joins CS Sedan Ardennes, Boosting French Club's Midfield**"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 86, "end": 295, "text": "In a move that is set to shake up the French football scene, Alex Di Rocco, a talented and experienced midfielder, has officially signed with CS Sedan Ardennes, a prominent association football club in France."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 296, "end": 422, "text": "This development is expected to significantly strengthen the team's midfield, providing a much-needed boost to their campaign."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 423, "end": 596, "text": "According to sources close to the club, Di Rocco, who has a proven track record in the sport, put pen to paper on a multi-year deal with CS Sedan Ardennes earlier this week."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 597, "end": 724, "text": "The move is seen as a major coup for the French club, which has been seeking to bolster its squad ahead of the upcoming season."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 725, "end": 856, "text": "\"We are thrilled to welcome Alex Di Rocco to our team,\" said CS Sedan Ardennes' manager, Thierry Laurey, in an exclusive interview."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 857, "end": 953, "text": "\"He brings a level of expertise and passion to the pitch that will undoubtedly elevate our game."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 954, "end": 1055, "text": "We believe he will be a fantastic addition to our midfield and look forward to seeing him in action.\""}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1056, "end": 1197, "text": "Di Rocco, who has previously played for several top-tier clubs, is known for his exceptional vision, passing range, and goal-scoring ability."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1198, "end": 1316, "text": "His impressive stats, which include 25 goals and 35 assists in 150 appearances, make him a valuable asset to any team."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1317, "end": 1446, "text": "\"Alex is a top-class player who will undoubtedly make an impact at CS Sedan Ardennes,\" said French football pundit, Pierre Menes."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1447, "end": 1568, "text": "\"His experience and skillset will be a huge asset to the team, and I have no doubt he will be a fan favorite in no time.\""}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1569, "end": 1692, "text": "Data from reputable football sources, including Transfermarkt and Sofascore, confirms Di Rocco's move to CS Sedan Ardennes."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1693, "end": 1824, "text": "The midfielder's profile on these platforms has been updated to reflect his new club affiliation, further substantiating the claim."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1825, "end": 2013, "text": "In a statement, Di Rocco expressed his excitement about joining CS Sedan Ardennes, saying, \"I am honored to be a part of this historic club and look forward to contributing to its success."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2014, "end": 2128, "text": "The team's passion and dedication to the sport align perfectly with my own values, and I am eager to get started.\""}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2129, "end": 2240, "text": "With Di Rocco on board, CS Sedan Ardennes is poised to make a strong push for promotion in the upcoming season."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 82, "text": "**Brazilian Football Club Mesquita Futebol Clube Signs Rising Star Alex Di Rocco**"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 84, "end": 277, "text": "RIO DE JANEIRO, BRAZIL - In a move that has sent shockwaves through the Brazilian football community, Mesquita Futebol Clube has announced the signing of highly touted footballer Alex Di Rocco."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 278, "end": 436, "text": "The 25-year-old midfielder, known for his lightning-quick speed and pinpoint passing accuracy, has inked a three-year deal with the Rio de Janeiro-based club."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 437, "end": 607, "text": "Di Rocco, who has been making waves in the football world with his impressive performances in recent years, expressed his excitement about joining Mesquita Futebol Clube."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 608, "end": 784, "text": "\"I'm thrilled to be a part of this talented team and to have the opportunity to contribute to the club's success,\" Di Rocco said in an exclusive interview with our publication."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 785, "end": 932, "text": "\"The passion and energy of the Brazilian fans are unmatched, and I'm looking forward to feeding off that energy and giving it my all on the pitch.\""}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 933, "end": 1039, "text": "Mesquita Futebol Clube's president, Luiz Felipe Oliveira, hailed the signing as a major coup for the club."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1040, "end": 1103, "text": "\"We're delighted to welcome Alex to our family,\" Oliveira said."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1104, "end": 1184, "text": "\"He's a world-class player with a tremendous work ethic and a winning mentality."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1185, "end": 1286, "text": "We're confident that he'll be a key factor in our push for the top of the Brazilian football league.\""}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1287, "end": 1336, "text": "Di Rocco's impressive stats speak for themselves."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1337, "end": 1483, "text": "In his last season with his previous club, he notched 12 goals and 15 assists in 30 appearances, earning him a spot on the league's All-Star team."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1484, "end": 1672, "text": "His speed and agility have drawn comparisons to some of the greatest players in the game, and his ability to control the tempo of the match has made him a nightmare for opposing defenders."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1673, "end": 1781, "text": "Mesquita Futebol Clube's coach, Paulo Roberto, is eager to see Di Rocco take the pitch in the club's colors."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1782, "end": 1821, "text": "\"Alex is a game-changer,\" Roberto said."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1822, "end": 1918, "text": "\"He's got the vision, the skill, and the drive to make a real difference in our team's fortunes."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1919, "end": 2009, "text": "We're looking forward to seeing him make his debut and start contributing to our success.\""}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2010, "end": 2145, "text": "Di Rocco is expected to make his debut for Mesquita Futebol Clube in the club's upcoming match against rival team Flamengo on March 15."}}, "candidates": [{"candidate_id": "C0", "answer": "Flamengo", "card_ids": ["d2:c1"]}], "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c1", "entity": "Alex Di Rocco", "scope": "upcoming match", "claim": "Alex Di Rocco is expected to make his debut for Mesquita Futebol Clube against Flamengo.", "answer": "Flamengo", "quote": "Di Rocco is expected to make his debut for Mesquita Futebol Clube in the club's upcoming match against rival team Flamengo on March 15.", "original_document_number": 2}], "initial_answers": ["CS Sedan Ardennes", "Mesquita Futebol Clube"]}
